# Mind Bend replaces the basic land type Swamp with Island in Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth's text (CR 612.1, layer 3), and "this
# effect lasts indefinitely": "Each land is a Swamp in addition to its other land types" now says Island (CR 305.7, layer 4),
# so Bot2's Forest is a Forest Island and Urborg an Island, and still so on the turns after (unlike Trait Doctoring's,
# which ends with the turn). Urborg taps for {U} from its basic land type (CR 305.6). Its name is not changed (CR 612.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth
Mind Bend
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Play
? Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: {U})
Bot1.Hand.Mind Bend.Cast(Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Replace a basic land type)
Bot1.Modes(Swamp)
Bot1.Modes(Island)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Subtypes = Island
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest; Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Mind Bend
